    sourceUrl: "https://www.trailwatch.hk/plan-share/279438",
    title: "Lamma Island (Accessible)",
    titleZh: "南丫島（無障礙）",
    desc: "Lamma Island is Hong Kong's fourth largest island, featuring Yung Shue Wan Pier in the north and Sok Kwu Wan Pier in the south, with only Yung Shue Wan Pier providing barrier-free access. This coastal route commences at Yung Shue Wan Pier, passing through Tai Wan To Beach and Hung Shing Ye Beach in succession, offering panoramic coastal vistas. Trail Conditions: - Concrete footpaths / village paths Public Transportation: Hong Kong and Kowloon Ferry (service between Central Pier No. 4 and Yung Shue Wan, Lamma Island) Accessible Toilet: 2/F of the North Lamma Public Library (closed on Thursdays), Hung Shing Ye Beach (Remark: Yung Shue Wan Public Toilet is currently under refurbishment work, scheduled to reopen in April 2026) Supply Locations: The restaurants along Yung Shue Wan Main Street to Back Street, the water refilling station and and beverage vending machines at Hung Shing Ye Beach (with barrier posts at the entrance, passage only 23–27 inches wide) Recommendations: - Best to go accompanied - Bring enough water and snacks - Check wheelchair equipment (e.g. conditions of wheel, battery) beforehand - Due to ongoing works, village vehicles may occasionally pass along the route; please exercise caution for your safety. - Ferries provide more than one wheelchair berthing space (subject to vessel type), making the route suitable for multiple wheelchair users travelling together. User comments: Hung Shing Ye Beach and Tai Wan To Beach offer expansive views; the road surface features numerous ascending and descending sections, so it is advisable to bring an accompanying person; the door and lock of the toilet at Hung Shing Ye Beach require improvement.",
    descZh: "南丫島是香港第四大島嶼，島北設榕樹灣碼頭，島南則有索罟灣碼頭，當中僅榕樹灣碼頭設有無障礙通道。此近岸路線由榕樹灣碼頭起，先後走經大灣肚沙灘與洪聖爺泳灘，盡攬海岸景致。 - 水泥行人道 / 村道 公共交通： 港九小輪（往返中環4號碼頭及南丫島榕樹灣） 無障礙洗手間：南丫島北段公共圖書館二樓（逢星期四休息）、洪聖爺泳灘 （備註：榕樹灣公廁現正進行翻新工程，預計於2026年4月重開） 補給位置：榕樹灣大街至後街一帶的食肆、洪聖爺灣泳灘的加水站及自動飲品販售機（通道前設有欄柱，通道僅23 - 27 英吋闊） 建議事項： - 建議結伴同行 - 要有足夠體力及糧水 - 出發前要先檢查輪椅裝備，如輪軚狀況或電動輪椅的電量等 - 因工程關係，沿途時有鄉村車輛經過，必須注意安全 - 渡輪提供多於一個輪椅停泊位置（視乎船種），路線適合多名輪椅使用者同行 使用者簡評：洪聖爺灣泳灘及大灣肚沙灘景觀開揚；路面有很多上下坡路段，建議帶同陪同者；洪聖爺灣泳灘的洗手間的大門與門鎖有待改善",
    itinerary: "Yung Shue Wan Pier › Lamma Power Station Beach › Hung Shing Yeh Beach › Lamma Power Station Beach › Yung Shue Wan Pier",
