    title: "East Coast Boardwalk (Accessible)",
    titleZh: "東岸板道（無障礙）",
    desc: "The East Coast Boardwalk is a coastal walkway linking Fortress Hill to Quarry Bay. Spanning approximately 2.2 kilometres, it comprises eastern and western sections, with the latter opening in early 2025 and the former following in late 2025. Certain sections feature “shared paths” for walking, jogging or cycling, alongside an experiential glass observatory deck” enabling wheelchair users to admire Victoria Harbour through the glass walkway beneath their feet. Distance: Approximately 4.2 km Trail Conditions: - Wide footpaths, brick or concrete pavements Public transport: [Starting Point] MTR Tin Hau Station（Exit A1） [Finishing Point] MTR Quarry Bay Station（Exit C） Toilets (equipped with barrier-free facilities): East Coast Boardwalk (3 in total) North Point Promenade Mobile Toilets (equipped with barrier-free facilities): East Coast Park Precinct Locations for Water Filling Station: Restaurants at Harbour North Recommendations: - Hiking buddies are recommended (MTR train can accommodate multiple wheelchair users) - Ensure you are physically fit for the visit and bring adequate food and water - Check your wheelchair conditions before setting off, such as the condition of wheels and battery level of the electric wheelchair User comments: The landscape is open and unobstructed, with level paving and ramps facilitating wheelchair access. The accessible toilet on the boardwalk is rather unclean and the floor is slippery.",
    descZh: "北角東岸板道是一段連接炮台山與鰂魚涌的海濱步道。板道全長約2.2公里，分作東西兩段，後者於2025年年初啟用，前者於同年年末啟用。板道部分路段設「共享徑」供市民步行、緩跑或騎單車，更設「體驗式玻璃觀景台」，可讓輪椅使用者透過玻璃步道觀賞腳下的維港。 - 寬闊的步行徑、磚砌及水泥行人道 公共交通： [起點]：天后港鐵站（A1出口） [終點]：鰂魚涌港鐵站（C出口） 無障礙洗手間：東岸板道（共3個）、北角海濱公園 流動無障礙洗手間：東岸公園主題區 補給位置：北角匯食肆 建議事項： - 建議結伴同行 - 要有足夠體力及糧水 - 出發前要先檢查輪椅裝備，如輪軚狀況或電動輪椅的展覽館外量等 使用者簡評：景觀開揚，路面平坦，設有斜坡方便輛椅出入。板道上的無障礙洗手間較污穢不潔，地面濕滑。",
    itinerary: "MTR Tin Hau Station › East Coast Boardwalk › MTR Quarry Bay Station",
    itineraryZh: "天后港鐵站 > 東岸板道 > 鰂魚涌港鐵站",
