    titleZh: "上窰（無障礙）",
    desc: "Sheung Yiu is located at Pak Tam Chung, Sai Kung, and the second Physically Handicapped and Able-Bodied (P.H.A.B) Site in Hong Kong is also situated here. Sheung Yiu Village has a history of nearly 200 years and was designated as a declared monument in 1981. It was later opened to the public as Sheung Yiu Folk Museum after renovation. The trail starts at the Pak Tam Chung P.H.A.B Site, follows the Pak Tam Chung Nature Trail, passing by the lime kiln and the Sheung Yiu Folk Museum, and ends at the pier near the Bradbury Camp, before returning along the same path. Trail Conditions: - The concrete village path is relatively narrow, with some sections’ surface uneven. - The section leading down to the pier is relatively steep (slope of about 17 degrees, or 1:3). Public Transportation: Kowloon Bus No. 94；33R、74R、96R、289R（Saturdays, Sundays and holidays） （Get off at Pak Tam Chung station） Accessible Toilet: Next to Pak Tam Chung Refreshment Kiosk and near the entrance of the Pak Tam Chung P.H.A.B. Site Location for Supplies: Pak Tam Chung Refreshment Kiosk; water filling stations next to Pak Tam Chung Refreshment Kiosk and near the entrance of the Pak Tam Chung P.H.A.B. Site Recommendations: - Best to go accompanied - Bring enough water and snacks - Check wheelchair equipment (e.g. conditions of wheel, battery) beforehand",
    descZh: "上窰位於西貢北潭涌，香港第二個傷健樂園——北潭涌傷健樂園亦坐落於此。上窰村有近200年歷史，於1981年被列為香港法定古蹟，其後被闢為上窰民俗文物館。 - 水泥村徑較狹窄，部分路段有凹凸坑紋 - 下降至碼頭的一段路較斜（斜度約17度，即1：3） 公共交通： 九巴 94；33R、74R、96R、289R號（星期六、日及假期服務） （北潭涌站下車） 無障礙洗手間：北潭涌茶水亭旁、北潭涌傷健樂園入口 補給位置：北潭涌茶水亭、茶水亭旁的加水站、北潭涌傷健樂園入口的加水站 建議事項： - 建議結伴同行 - 要有足夠體力及糧水 - 出發前要先檢查輪椅裝備，如輪軚狀況或電動輪椅的電量等",
