    title: "Tai Po Kau Forest Walk Red Walk",
    titleZh: "大埔滘林徑紅路",
    desc: "The Tai Po Kau Nature Reserve offers four forest walks of varying lengths, all well-paved circular trails with informational maps at their starting points. The Reserve has complete and mature secondary forests with a diverse range of distinct plant species, abundant in ferns, moss, and other plants, making it a favored habitat for birds and insects. The Red Walk is the shortest among the forest walks, featuring clear signposts along a shaded path, ideal for nature enthusiasts to take a leisurely stroll and appreciate the natural scenery and ecology. Distance: Approximately 2.6 km [Starting point and Finishing point] Chung Tsai Yuen Bus Stop - KMB bus routes 72, 72A, 73A or 74A; or - Green minibus route 28K Location of Water Filling Station: - Tai Po Kau Outdoor Study Centre Entrance",
    descZh: "大埔滘自然護理區設有四條不同長短途的林徑，全是鋪設良好的環迴山徑，起點設有地圖資訊牌。大埔滘自然護理區擁有完整和成熟的次生林，植物種類多樣且各具特色，滿佈蕨類、苔蘚等植物，是林鳥及昆蟲所喜愛的棲息地。紅路是四色林徑中最短的路線，是一條設有清晰指示牌的林蔭山徑，十分適合愛好大自然景色及生態的人前來漫步。 [ 起點及終點 ] 松仔園站 - 九巴72、72A、73A或74A號；或 - 專線小巴28K號 加水站位置： - 大埔滘野外研習園入口",
